#. +> trunk
#: cppdebugger/debuggerplugin.cpp:301
msgid ""
"<b>Step out</b>"
"<p>Executes the application until the currently executing function is completed. The debugger will then display the line after the original call to that function. If program execution is in the outermost frame (i.e. in main()) then this operation has no effect."
msgstr ""
"<b>Rutgahn</b>"
"<p>Föhrt dat Programm ut, bet de aktuelle Funkschoon heel utföhrt is. De Fehlersöker wiest denn de Reeg achter den Orginaal-Funkschoonoproop. Wenn he den Butenrahmen utföhrt (t.B. \"main()\"), blifft disse Akschoon ahn Utwarken."

