#. +> trunk
#: cppdebugger/debuggerplugin.cpp:324
msgid ""
"<b>Examine core file</b>"
"<p>This loads a core file, which is typically created after the application has crashed, e.g. with a segmentation fault. The core file contains an image of the program memory at the time it crashed, allowing you to do a post-mortem analysis."
msgstr ""
"<b>Karndatei bekieken</b>"
"<p>Disse Funkschoon laadt en Karndatei, de normalerwies opstellt warrt, wenn dat Programm afstört is, t.B. mit en Spiekertogriep-Fehler. De Karndatei bargt en Afbild vun den Programmspieker, as he bi den Afstört weer, so dat Du em later noch bekieken kannst."

